!! Nova : textes (en) des restriction d'acces, ecarts des zones, desactivation forcee (_widgets/acces-classe, ecarts-zones, desactiver).
!! Lus seulement par ces gabarits (2026-11-11) : name.phtml, lu sur CHAQUE page, faisait deborder le tampon des noms
!! de variables de WIMS (32 Ko, src/var.c : variable_name_buffer_overflow sur un exercice d'une feuille).
!! Encodage latin-1 : WIMS sert ses pages en windows-1252.
!! Appearance and Nova badges pages of a structure (2026-11-07): zones with different settings. %n number, %q what.
!set nova_ecart_titre=%n dependent zones do not use these %q settings
!set nova_ecart_titre1=1 dependent zone does not use these %q settings
!set nova_ecart_quoi_apparence=of Nova (display, students, advanced)
!set nova_ecart_quoi_badges=of Nova (WIMS homework, badges)
!set nova_ecart_texte=They have their own settings: an older copy, or a setting made in the zone.
!set nova_ecart_texte1=It has its own settings: an older copy, or a setting made in the zone.
!set nova_ecart_voir=Show the zones
!set nova_ecart_appliquer=Apply these settings to all zones
!set nova_ecart_plus_tard=Later
!set nova_ecart_attente=Save your changes first, then apply them to the zones.
!set nova_forcer_bouton=Deactivate anyway...
!set nova_forcer_titre_exam=Deactivate exam %1 despite sharing?
!set nova_forcer_titre_sheet=Deactivate sheet %1 despite sharing?
!set nova_forcer_points_exam=It will be deactivated in every class sharing your exams: their students will no longer see it.|It goes back to "In preparation": its content can be changed again. Changing, adding or moving exercises puts the recorded scores out of step.|Scores already recorded are kept.|WIMS forbids it for these reasons: only do it if you know what you are doing.
!set nova_forcer_points_sheet=It will be deactivated in every class sharing your sheets: their students will no longer see it.|It goes back to "In preparation": its content can be changed again. Changing, adding or moving exercises puts the recorded scores out of step.|Scores already recorded are kept.|WIMS forbids it for these reasons: only do it if you know what you are doing.
!set nova_forcer_ok=Deactivate anyway
!set nova_forcer_annuler=Cancel
!set nova_desact_ok_exam=Exam %1 deactivated in every sharing class: it is in preparation.
!set nova_desact_ok_sheet=Sheet %1 deactivated in every sharing class: it is in preparation.
!set nova_desact_refus_statut=Nothing was deactivated: item %1 is not active.
!set nova_desact_refus_commence=Nothing was deactivated: students have already started exam %1.
!set nova_desact_refus_reglage=Nothing was deactivated: deactivating despite sharing is not allowed in this class (Appearance page).
!set nova_desact_refus_erreur=Nothing was deactivated (error).
!set nova_forcer_point_examen=Exercises of this sheet are used in an exam: changing them also changes that exam, and its students' scores.
!set nova_forcer_refus_commence=Nova cannot deactivate it either: students have already started this exam.
