!set nova_avs_retour_texte=Each student's avatar and colour are stored with their scores; Nova versions from before 12 November 2026 look for them elsewhere. Before reinstalling one of those versions, this button copies them back to the old location, for all students of the class or structure. Do it just before changing version: a student's copy is removed as soon as they log in again with the current version.
